<title>ROMANIA: Romanian MiG fighter crashes, pilot ejects safely.</title>
<headline>Romanian MiG fighter crashes, pilot ejects safely.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Romanian air force Soviet-made MiG fighter jet crashed on a training flight on Thursday but the pilot managed to eject, local television reported.</p>
<p>Private broadcaster Pro TV said the jet crashed in the eastern county of Bacau. Its pilot suffered minor fractures after ejecting.</p>
